# Title: Python Spawning Pretty TTY on Windows
# ID: 480e7e51-e797-47e3-8d72-ebfce65b6d8d
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nextron Systems
# Date: 2022-06-03
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059
# Description: Detects python spawning a pretty tty
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_path="*python.exe" OR process_path="*python3.exe" OR process_path="*python2.exe")) AND (((process_exec="*import pty*" AND process_exec="*.spawn(*")) OR (process_exec="*from pty import spawn*")))
